red/evidence-status.json.","citation_ids":["cite.long.thm-seam-limit"],"evidence_ids":["mapping.long.thm-seam-limit"],"id":"long.thm-seam-limit","kind":"claim","label":"Long record Theorem 6.2 (The quotient remainders converge to the greedy deficit)","locator":"Long record Theorem 6.2, p. 45, label thm:seam-limit","source_id":"paper.long.pdf","statement":"*Let $G$ be the real greedy support for $1/2$, and let $D_s$ be the integer-greedy support at row $s$. Then\n$$\nX_{D_s}(2)\\longrightarrow X_G(2),\\qquad\n \\frac{\\mathrm{rem}(s)}{4^s}\\longrightarrow\n \\delta:=\\frac12-X_G(2)\\ge0.\n$$\nIn particular, the following conditions are equivalent: $1/2\\in\\mathcal A$; the full sequence $\\mathrm{rem}(s)/4^s$ tends to zero; and there exist $s_j\\to\\infty$ with $\\mathrm{rem}(s_j)/4^{s_j}\\to0$.*","status":"unverified"},"ref":"sha256:57133a32273c39019ea3f4ba3de79281b7177858848a9345731e250a68a8c176/nodes/long.thm-seam-limit","relations":[{"derived":false,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:57133a32273c39019ea3f4ba3de79281b7177858848a9345731e250a68a8c176/nodes/long.thm-seam-limit","id":"sha256:57133a32273c39019ea3f4ba3de79281b7177858848a9345731e250a68a8c176/edges/%5B%22long.thm-seam-limit%22%2C%22lean.ErdosProblems.Erdos257.PaperCompleteR21.abs_supportValue_sub_le_mersenneTail%22%2C%22formalizes%22%5D","kind":"formalizes","record_ref":"sha256:57133a32273c39019ea3f4ba3de79281b7177858848a9345731e250a68a8c176/edges/%5B%22long.thm-seam-limit%22%2C%22lean.ErdosProblems.Erdos257.PaperCompleteR21.abs_supportValue_sub_le_mersenneTail%22%2C%22formalizes%22%5D","semantic_class":"formalization_correspondence","to":"sha256:57133a32273c39019ea3f4ba3de79281b7177858848a9345731e250a68a8c176/nodes/lean.ErdosProblems.Erdos257.PaperCompleteR21.abs_supportValue_sub_le_mersenneTail"},{"derived":false,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:57133a32273c39019ea3f4ba3de79281b7177858848a9345731e250a68a8c176/nodes/long.thm-seam-limit","id":"sha256:57133a32273c39019ea3f4ba3de79281b7177858848a9345731